// TIADECHE'S KARAMBWAN STALL, the last of this quest's dead clicks.
//
// Tiadeche carries op3=Trade once the Trio is over - the cache has had it all along - and nothing
// answered it: no category, no owned_shop, no stock. "Tiadeche's Karambwan Stall is a store in Tai
// Bwo Wannai owned by Tiadeche. It sells raw karambwan and karambwan vessels, and can only be
// accessed after completion of Tai Bwo Wannai Trio, in which Tiadeche is shown how to fish."
// (https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Tiadeche%27s_Karambwan_Stall)
//
// The stock and the restock rates are the live shop's own. Raw karambwan restocks fast, which is
// the whole reason the stall is worth walking to - the wiki's own page is mostly about people
// emptying it.
//
// THE KARAMBWANJI ROW IS DELIBERATELY ABSENT. The live shop carries 50 of them now, and it did not
// until the Fireworks and karambwan! update of 10 August 2017; this build is 2006. The two things
// it sold on the day it opened are what it sells here.
[tbwt_karambwan_stall]
scope=shared
size=8
restock=yes
stackall=yes
allstock=no
stock1=tbwt_raw_karambwan,10,10
stock2=tbwt_karambwan_vessel,2,100
